(2) Soil erosion and sedimentation;
(3) Protected areas;
(4) Pollution of surface and sub-surface water.
(f) Utilities:
(1) Sewage disposal;
(2) Water supply;
(3) Whether the proposed method of sewage treatment is consistent with the county sewer master plan;
(4) Whether the proposed rezoning and proposed water usage is consistent with the county water master plan; Page 3 of 3
(5) Whether the proposed rezoning is consistent with any and all regional agreements, e.g., regional water agreements and regional sewer agreements.
(g) Other special considerations:
