(2) Noise;
(3) Odor;
(4) Fire protection;
(5) Terrain or topography;
(6) Schools;
(7) Animals;
(8) Visual intrusions on neighbors;
(9) Aesthetics;
(10) Site plans and plats;
(11) Lighting;
(12) Hours of operation.
